{"segments": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 4.76, "text": "in 2023, where Fannie basically came out and said,"}, {"start": 5.06, "end": 6.94, "text": "5% down on all two to four units"}, {"start": 6.94, "end": 9.26, "text": "is what will be required going forward."}, {"start": 9.46, "end": 11.0, "text": "It used to be you would call around"}, {"start": 11.0, "end": 12.5, "text": "and you'd want 5% down."}, {"start": 12.68, "end": 14.24, "text": "And once they found out you were buying a multi,"}, {"start": 14.38, "end": 15.76, "text": "they'd say, no, you have to put 20."}, {"start": 15.8, "end": 16.68, "text": "They'd laugh at you."}, {"start": 16.96, "end": 18.62, "text": "Yeah, that's not the case anymore."}, {"start": 18.8, "end": 21.6, "text": "It's pretty industry standard now, 5% down."}, {"start": 22.04, "end": 24.4, "text": "Also, lenders know how to underwrite these better."}, {"start": 24.64, "end": 27.16, "text": "Before, it was difficult to qualify"}, {"start": 27.76, "end": 30.34, "text": "for how much a multifamily was gonna cost you"}, {"start": 30.34, "end": 32.32, "text": "because multifamilies would typically cost"}, {"start": 32.32, "end": 33.4, "text": "more than single families."}, {"start": 33.72, "end": 35.68, "text": "But now they know how to underwrite them"}, {"start": 35.68, "end": 38.52, "text": "and they'll actually consider the rents"}, {"start": 39.26, "end": 43.62, "text": "for the property you're looking to buy as income for you."}, {"start": 44.16, "end": 47.0, "text": "And that increases the income that you earn,"}, {"start": 47.0, "end": 50.2, "text": "essentially allowing you to qualify for more."}, {"start": 50.42, "end": 52.82, "text": "So it's easier to get approved to do these now."}, {"start": 52.9, "end": 54.74, "text": "The process is a lot easier now"}, {"start": 54.74, "end": 57.06, "text": "than it was prior to 2023,"}, {"start": 57.36, "end": 58.86, "text": "just to get approved to do these."}], "words": [{"w": "in", "start":